{"seq":1,"slug":"gateway-logging-metrics","title":"网关日志与指标：构建 API 层的可见性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/observability/gateway-logging-metrics","wordCount":611,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"网关日志与指标-构建-api-层的可见性\">网关日志与指标：构建 API 层的可见性</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>访问日志（Access Log）</strong></td>\n<td>每个请求的记录（时间、路径、状态码、延迟、大小）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>黄金指标（Golden Signals）</strong></td>\n<td>延迟、流量（QPS）、错误率、饱和度——四个衡量服务健康的核心指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>P99 延迟</strong></td>\n<td>第 99 百分位延迟，比平均延迟更能反映用户的实际体验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>日志采样</strong></td>\n<td>高流量时只记录部分请求的详细日志，降低存储成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>结构化日志</strong></td>\n<td>JSON 格式的日志，便于机器解析和聚合查询</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"网关访问日志\">网关访问日志</h2><p>网关的访问日志是系统流量的&quot;账本&quot;，记录每一个进出请求的关键信息。</p>\n<h3 id=\"标准日志字段\">标准日志字段</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;timestamp&quot;: &quot;2026-07-04T08:00:00.123Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;request_id&quot;: &quot;req-abc123&quot;, // 追踪 ID（对应 X-Request-ID Header）&#10;  &quot;method&quot;: &quot;POST&quot;,&#10;  &quot;path&quot;: &quot;/api/v1/orders&quot;,&#10;  &quot;query&quot;: &quot;?source=app&quot;,&#10;  &quot;status&quot;: 201,&#10;  &quot;latency_ms&quot;: 125, // 总延迟（从收到请求到响应完成）&#10;  &quot;upstream_latency_ms&quot;: 118, // 上游处理时间（后端耗时）&#10;  &quot;request_size&quot;: 256, // 请求体字节数&#10;  &quot;response_size&quot;: 512, // 响应体字节数&#10;  &quot;client_ip&quot;: &quot;1.2.3.4&quot;,&#10;  &quot;user_id&quot;: &quot;user123&quot;, // 认证后注入&#10;  &quot;consumer&quot;: &quot;mobile-app-v3&quot;, // API Key 对应的消费者&#10;  &quot;route&quot;: &quot;create-order&quot;, // 匹配的路由名&#10;  &quot;upstream&quot;: &quot;order-service&quot;, // 后端服务名&#10;  &quot;retry_count&quot;: 0, // 重试次数&#10;  &quot;cache_hit&quot;: false // 是否命中缓存&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"timestamp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-07-04T08:00:00.123Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"request_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"req-abc123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 追踪 ID（对应 X-Request-ID Header）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"method\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"POST\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/api/v1/orders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"?source=app\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">201</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"latency_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">125</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 总延迟（从收到请求到响应完成）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"upstream_latency_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">118</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 上游处理时间（后端耗时）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"request_size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 请求体字节数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"response_size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 响应体字节数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"client_ip\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.2.3.4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"user_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 认证后注入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"consumer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mobile-app-v3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// API Key 对应的消费者</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"route\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"create-order\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 匹配的路由名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"upstream\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order-service\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 后端服务名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"retry_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 重试次数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"cache_hit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 是否命中缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>结构化日志（JSON）比文本格式更易于 Elasticsearch/Loki 查询。</p>\n<h3 id=\"日志级别与采样策略\">日志级别与采样策略</h3><p>每个请求都记录完整日志在高流量下会产生大量 I/O。策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"成功请求（2xx）: 采样 1%（统计用，不需要每条都保留）&#10;4xx 错误: 全量记录（通常是用户错误，需要分析）&#10;5xx 错误: 全量记录（后端故障，必须保留）&#10;慢请求（latency &gt; 500ms）: 全量记录（性能分析）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>成功请求（2xx）: 采样 1%（统计用，不需要每条都保留）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4xx 错误: 全量记录（通常是用户错误，需要分析）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>5xx 错误: 全量记录（后端故障，必须保留）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>慢请求（latency > 500ms）: 全量记录（性能分析）</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func shouldLog(resp *Response) bool {&#10;    if resp.StatusCode &gt;= 500 {&#10;        return true // 全量&#10;    }&#10;    if resp.StatusCode &gt;= 400 {&#10;        return true // 全量&#10;    }&#10;    if resp.LatencyMS &gt; 500 {&#10;        return true // 慢请求全量&#10;    }&#10;    return rand.Float64() &lt; 0.01 // 2xx 采样 1%&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> shouldLog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">resp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> resp.StatusCode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 全量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> resp.StatusCode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 全量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> resp.LatencyMS </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 慢请求全量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rand.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Float64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.01</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 2xx 采样 1%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"四个黄金指标-google-sre\">四个黄金指标（Google SRE）</h2><p>Google SRE 提出的四个黄金指标，是衡量服务健康状态的核心 Metrics：</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-延迟-latency\">1. 延迟（Latency）</h3><p>监控 P50、P95、P99、P999，而不只是平均值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# Prometheus 指标（Histogram）&#10;gateway_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route=&quot;create-order&quot;, le=&quot;0.1&quot;} 8500&#10;gateway_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route=&quot;create-order&quot;, le=&quot;0.5&quot;} 9800&#10;gateway_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route=&quot;create-order&quot;, le=&quot;1.0&quot;} 9950&#10;gateway_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route=&quot;create-order&quot;, le=&quot;+Inf&quot;} 10000&#10;&#10;# PromQL 查询 P99 延迟&#10;histogram_quantile(0.99, rate(gateway_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m]))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Prometheus 指标（Histogram）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>gateway_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route=\"create-order\", le=\"0.1\"} 8500</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>gateway_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route=\"create-order\", le=\"0.5\"} 9800</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>gateway_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route=\"create-order\", le=\"1.0\"} 9950</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>gateway_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route=\"create-order\", le=\"+Inf\"} 10000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># PromQL 查询 P99 延迟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>histogram_quantile(0.99, rate(gateway_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m]))</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"2-流量-traffic\">2. 流量（Traffic）</h3><p>QPS 趋势图，用于容量规划和异常检测：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# 请求总量（Counter）&#10;gateway_requests_total{route, method, status_class}&#10;&#10;# 实时 QPS&#10;rate(gateway_requests_total[1m])\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 请求总量（Counter）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>gateway_requests_total{route, method, status_class}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 实时 QPS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>rate(gateway_requests_total[1m])</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"3-错误率-errors\">3. 错误率（Errors）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# 错误率告警：5 分钟内错误率 &gt; 1%&#10;sum(rate(gateway_requests_total{status_class=&quot;5xx&quot;}[5m]))&#10;/ sum(rate(gateway_requests_total[5m])) &gt; 0.01\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 错误率告警：5 分钟内错误率 > 1%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sum(rate(gateway_requests_total{status_class=\"5xx\"}[5m]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/ sum(rate(gateway_requests_total[5m])) > 0.01</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"4-饱和度-saturation\">4. 饱和度（Saturation）</h3><p>网关的资源利用率——连接池、内存、CPU：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# 活跃连接数 vs 连接池上限&#10;gateway_active_connections / gateway_max_connections&#10;&#10;# 请求队列等待时间（反映 CPU 饱和）&#10;gateway_request_queue_duration_seconds\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 活跃连接数 vs 连接池上限</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>gateway_active_connections / gateway_max_connections</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 请求队列等待时间（反映 CPU 饱和）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>gateway_request_queue_duration_seconds</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"关键指标仪表盘\">关键指标仪表盘</h2><p>生产网关仪表盘应包含：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph Overview[&quot;总览(1m 刷新)&quot;]&#10;        QPS[QPS 趋势]&#10;        ERR[错误率 %]&#10;        LAT[P99 延迟]&#10;        ACT[活跃连接]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph ByRoute[&quot;按路由细分&quot;]&#10;        TOP[Top 10 慢路由]&#10;        ERR5[Top 5xx 路由]&#10;        THR[被限流的路由]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph Upstream[&quot;上游健康&quot;]&#10;        HEA[实例健康状态]&#10;        CB[熔断器状态]&#10;        RET[重试成功率]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph Overview[\"总览(1m 刷新)\"]\n        QPS[QPS 趋势]\n        ERR[错误率 %]\n        LAT[P99 延迟]\n        ACT[活跃连接]\n    end\n\n    subgraph ByRoute[\"按路由细分\"]\n        TOP[Top 10 慢路由]\n        ERR5[Top 5xx 路由]\n        THR[被限流的路由]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Upstream[\"上游健康\"]\n        HEA[实例健康状态]\n        CB[熔断器状态]\n        RET[重试成功率]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"告警规则设计\">告警规则设计</h2><p>好的告警应该是&quot;症状而非原因&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 错误率突增告警&#10;- alert: GatewayHighErrorRate&#10;  expr: |&#10;    sum(rate(gateway_requests_total{status=~&quot;5..&quot;}[5m]))&#10;    / sum(rate(gateway_requests_total[5m])) &gt; 0.05&#10;  for: 2m&#10;  labels:&#10;    severity: critical&#10;  annotations:&#10;    summary: &#39;网关 5xx 错误率超过 5%&#39;&#10;&#10;# 高延迟告警&#10;- alert: GatewayHighLatency&#10;  expr: |&#10;    histogram_quantile(0.99, rate(gateway_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) &gt; 1.0&#10;  for: 5m&#10;  labels:&#10;    severity: warning&#10;  annotations:&#10;    summary: &#39;P99 延迟超过 1 秒&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 错误率突增告警</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GatewayHighErrorRate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    sum(rate(gateway_requests_total{status=~\"5..\"}[5m]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    / sum(rate(gateway_requests_total[5m])) > 0.05</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">2m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">critical</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'网关 5xx 错误率超过 5%'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 高延迟告警</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GatewayHighLatency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    histogram_quantile(0.99, rate(gateway_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) > 1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">warning</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'P99 延迟超过 1 秒'</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>网关访问日志应采用结构化 JSON 格式，包含请求追踪 ID（X-Request-ID）、用户身份、上游耗时等关键字段，并按错误级别做采样（错误全量、成功采样）。四个黄金指标（延迟/流量/错误率/饱和度）是网关监控的核心，以 Histogram 记录延迟分位数。告警设计围绕&quot;症状&quot;（高错误率、高延迟）而非具体原因。链路追踪能力见下一篇<a href=\"distributed-tracing-gateway\">分布式链路追踪</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关键运维检查项\">关键运维检查项</h2><p>网关上线前确认以下可观测性配置：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>访问日志已开启结构化 JSON 格式，并包含 <code>request_id</code> 字段</li>\n<li>Prometheus Metrics 端点（<code>/metrics</code>）对监控系统可达</li>\n<li>告警规则已覆盖高错误率（&gt;5%）和高延迟（P99 &gt; 1s）两个核心 SLO</li>\n<li>日志采样策略已配置（5xx 全量，2xx 按比例采样）</li>\n<li>仪表盘已部署，包含 QPS、错误率、延迟分位数和上游健康状态四个面板</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"网关日志与指标：构建 API 层的可见性","id":"网关日志与指标-构建-api-层的可见性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"网关访问日志","id":"网关访问日志"},{"level":3,"text":"标准日志字段","id":"标准日志字段"},{"level":3,"text":"日志级别与采样策略","id":"日志级别与采样策略"},{"level":2,"text":"四个黄金指标（Google SRE）","id":"四个黄金指标-google-sre"},{"level":3,"text":"1. 延迟（Latency）","id":"1-延迟-latency"},{"level":3,"text":"2. 流量（Traffic）","id":"2-流量-traffic"},{"level":3,"text":"3. 错误率（Errors）","id":"3-错误率-errors"},{"level":3,"text":"4. 饱和度（Saturation）","id":"4-饱和度-saturation"},{"level":2,"text":"关键指标仪表盘","id":"关键指标仪表盘"},{"level":2,"text":"告警规则设计","id":"告警规则设计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"关键运维检查项","id":"关键运维检查项"}],"prev":{"title":"网关层缓存：减少后端压力的响应缓存策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/resilience/caching-gateway"},"next":{"title":"分布式链路追踪：网关如何成为追踪的起点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/observability/distributed-tracing-gateway"}}